\\\  & =-c+a \\\\  & =a-c.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-69531/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "66c43200-991b-5854-be1d-fa9db80f3725"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-69531"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-143000/selection/aacea2aad9c1efb889adea2fd0ee9375ecf074b4daa640f9b9d1fcebd263823a" :answer/id #uuid "d535d08b-938a-598b-afe1-e8c2c7744313" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{TP}=a+b-c" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-143000/selection/2d7c94bb00e886cc4c319ea77498d4879ff7ac0d0eec152ac41d269aa10d1f10" :answer/id #uuid "11953917-9d63-57a0-bdea-5cb9a074c0a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{TP}=a-c+d" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-143000/selection/478ea6a4e06310b362ad3ed5e84914a737424359416f0739d17e7defda0a48a6" :answer/id #uuid "a2464355-b675-57af-a519-90c95bc7dff7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{TP}=a+b-d" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-143000/selection/910d8035f0bb5ae8a390fd045c5bb73aeffe3a2b1b979ff725759753e1d6e0d4" :answer/id #uuid "044dae63-dd09-50c4-bfc1-25e37c1285d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{TP}=a-b+d" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-143000/selection/fdbb279cbb1c38a2956e5555026c66e267919060575e265d4efd35515929c390" :answer/id #uuid "b8a7e427-bf8d-5873-afc9-d4c302c875e1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{TP}=b-c-d" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-143000/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "1d6d9556-8ed3-53bb-b5f2-45e0d22165a5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-143000/selection/478ea6a4e06310b362ad3ed5e84914a737424359416f0739d17e7defda0a48a6" :answer-field/choices ["q-143000/selection/aacea2aad9c1efb889adea2fd0ee9375ecf074b4daa640f9b9d1fcebd263823a" "q-143000/selection/2d7c94bb00e886cc4c319ea77498d4879ff7ac0d0eec152ac41d269aa10d1f10" "q-143000/selection/478ea6a4e06310b362ad3ed5e84914a737424359416f0739d17e7defda0a48a6" "q-143000/selection/910d8035f0bb5ae8a390fd045c5bb73aeffe3a2b1b979ff725759753e1d6e0d4" "q-143000/selection/fdbb279cbb1c38a2956e5555026c66e267919060575e265d4efd35515929c390"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-143000" :question/id #uuid "0819890e-e160-59bd-9c05-1d68eddaa3dc" :question/math-academy-id "q-143000" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040990/assets/a89c73fd1e50e3c2d28694a366c79c75ad5f1bbf63a5c1333a7d7b62f5a4a0e9.png)\n\nConsider the diagram shown above, where $\\overset{\\to }{QP}=a,$ $\\overset{\\to }{RQ}=b,$ $\\overset{\\to }{SQ}=c,$ and $\\overset{\\to }{RT}=d.$ Find $\\overset{\\to }{TP}$ in terms of $a,b,c,$ and $d.$" :question/worked-solution "We want to find a \"path\" from $T$ to $P$ consisting only of the vectors $a,b,c,$ and $d.$ \n\nAccording to the triangle law of addition,\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{TP}=\\overset{\\to }{TR}+\\overset{\\to }{RQ}+\\overset{\\to }{QP}\n$$\n\n \n\nas shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040990/assets/e0e6351dfbef6dadf6a6fb179f1545622ddaeab24c2c06dee03c87821304695c.png)\n\n \n\nNow, from the original diagram, we have that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{TR}=-d,\\,\\overset{\\to }{RQ}=b,\\,\\overset{\\to }{QP}=a.\n$$\n\nLet's add these to our diagram. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14040990/assets/02899ac9c536b0020514780db617e29977a5dc4daf60f42d80ed671883327fe3.png)\n\n \n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{TP} & =\\overset{\\to }{TR}+\\overset{\\to }{RQ}+\\overset{\\to }{QP} \\\\  & =-d+b+a \\\\  & =a+b-d.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-143000/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "33f0ec6b-9cb4-5246-9ac6-23b35e3b224e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-143000"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-142998/selection/43c4543a8f129ce8f3e9028b184a3f5793d81b2da5ee63908464226cd058c5c5" :answer/id #uuid "4228d490-431b-5816-95db-6e1426b5bc12" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{QS}=a-b-c" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-142998/selection/24771c1193edc1e40305830f54a4569f38fd8d74a4191a6f95520fda1911235a" :answer/id #uuid "1cf855aa-4511-5dec-ac3c-e00436fa5490" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{QS}=a+c+d" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-142998/selection/66d5cb70a7fb477b11a5e90413e741df58479030bb884bc8d99a00e1aa8f3209" :answer/id #uuid "0b8ea61e-7aad-53a1-aeb3-ddcb1929cca8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{QS}=a+c-d" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-142998/selection/e2b42211e274d088bc7976e05aeac08bbc13c09811590086b89759ae904c7641" :answer/id #uuid "1568084b-0125-5a16-803b-445ef3dfd70b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{QS}=b-a-c" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-142998/selection/e7f367fbbcb567a5d9d25f0cf8174000cb5801f4ed200d9cce1ea2ec4e09d0fc" :answer/id #uuid "0ac56997-f37e-5088-aaab-da0cff9a3939" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\overset{\\to }{QS}=a+c+b" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-142998/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "fc770885-2df9-503d-9f9b-cfc63d23be54" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-142998/selection/e7f367fbbcb567a5d9d25f0cf8174000cb5801f4ed200d9cce1ea2ec4e09d0fc" :answer-field/choices ["q-142998/selection/43c4543a8f129ce8f3e9028b184a3f5793d81b2da5ee63908464226cd058c5c5" "q-142998/selection/24771c1193edc1e40305830f54a4569f38fd8d74a4191a6f95520fda1911235a" "q-142998/selection/66d5cb70a7fb477b11a5e90413e741df58479030b